        <mxCell id="risk-note" value="&lt;b&gt;Trust/configuration caveats&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Services trust gateway-injected identity headers while Compose publishes service ports. Staging also sets an external Keycloak hostname but Kong's static issuer key remains localhost, so valid staging tokens will not match until configuration is aligned." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontColor=#7f1d1d;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
